passage:
image from SM94 M1: Potential RC & YIP/潜在原因及改进 at row 28, column 6. Related text: 1：Fix Location(FP Level)：SLY：Environment/环境：SLY Lamination rubber/Flatten stage：Defect mapping/缺陷分布(example)：Dent on fixed location of the full panels.   
The dent on SR surface looks smooth and no broken/scratch/crack：FM attach on rubber/SUS stage etc. which is not easy to remove.Panels touch on the stage/rubber, caused dent.：1.Regular machine PM to clean FM,and to reduce parts abrasion;
2.Collect FM: add sticky paper above and around rubber/SUS stage;
3.Clean FM from rubber/SUS stage towards one direction to avoid contaminate again;
4.Inspect first 2 panels per lot to reduce potential impact scope;
5.Control environment FM by APC chart;：Historical investigation report/历史调查报告.

image from SM94 M1: Potential RC & YIP/潜在原因及改进 at row 31, column 6. Related text: 4：Fix Location(unit level)：ETS：Environment/环境：Tester fixture：Defect mapping/缺陷分布(example)：Dent on fixed location of the units   
The dent on SR surface looks not smooth with slight broken/scratch/crack,and looks more white than dent caused SLY/SXP：FM on E-test fixture：1.Modify fixture structure to reduce contact area;
2.first 2 panels and mid-process inspection per lot to reduce potential impact scope;：Historical investigation report/历史调查报告.

